# Owner-reviewed paths. GitHub requests a review from the owner on any pull
# request that touches these. "Require review from Code Owners" is off: the
# repository has one person, who cannot approve his own pull requests (see
# LOOP.md). The four required checks and history-audit guard merges; this
# file notifies. The list mirrors the
# protected paths in scripts/gate_config.json (scope) plus the tests that
# guard the gates and the loop contract.
.github/**          @99yyy
scripts/**          @99yyy
tests/**            @99yyy
data/**             @99yyy
benchmarks/**       @99yyy
LOOP.md             @99yyy
README.md           @99yyy
tasks/TASK-*.md     @99yyy
# Agent instructions Cursor loads into every Cloud Agent. A pattern with no
# inner slash matches at any depth; with no trailing slash it matches the
# directory and everything in it, and also a file (a symlink) of that name.
.cursor             @99yyy
.agents             @99yyy
.claude             @99yyy
.codex              @99yyy
AGENTS.md           @99yyy
CLAUDE.md           @99yyy
.cursorrules        @99yyy
